```console
$ scherzo-cloud runner credential list --help
List non-secret runner credential metadata

Usage: scherzo-cloud runner credential list [OPTIONS] <ORGANIZATION> <RUNNER>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <RUNNER>        Runner ID or exact name

Options:
      --limit <LIMIT>        
      --cursor <CURSOR>      
      --json                 Print the runner result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                 Print help

```
